# PlayerProperty.java:185-188: Pack Attack's
# `X:PlayerCountPlayers$HasPropertyDefending` counts the players some attacker
# attacks directly. Cast after Grizzly Bears attacks the ai, X is 1: the Bears
# get +1/+0 and deal 3 combat damage, and the caster draws a card.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
tapformana human 2 R
tapformana human 3 R
tapformana human 4 R
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
castspell human 6
resolvestack
advance
queue blocks none
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
